{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["ev",{"VAR?":"met_rick_before"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"returning"},{"->":"0.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n",{"->":"first_meeting"},{"->":"0.5"},null]}],"nop","\n",["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"first_meeting":[["#","^meet_npc: barkeep","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"met_rick_before","re":true},"^Rick is polishing a glass. The glass is not getting cleaner. He doesn't seem to care.","\n","^Rick: ...","\n","^He looks up. Sighs.","\n","^Rick: Drink?","\n","ev","str","^I'm Eddie. I'm the new roadie.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What can you tell me about this place?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Just looking around.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Hmm.","\n","^He goes back to polishing the glass.","\n","^Rick: ...roadie. Okay.","\n","^Rick: *sigh*","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Rick: *grunt*","\n","^He gestures broadly at the bar. At the stains. At existence.","\n","^Rick: This.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-2":["\n","^Rick: Mm.","\n","^He nods. This constitutes a full conversation by Rick's standards.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"returning":[["^Rick looks up. Exhales through his nose. This is his version of \"welcome back.\"","\n","^Rick: ...","\n","ev","str","^Hey Rick.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Still polishing that glass?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Mm.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Rick: ...different glass.","\n","^A pause.","\n","^Rick: Same futility.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"main_menu":[["ev","str","^Know where I can find useful stuff around here?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Tell me about the venue's history.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^What do you serve here?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^What do you know about the Battle of the Bands?","/str",{"VAR?":"knows_about_botb"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^See you later, Rick.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"find_things"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"venue_history"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"drinks_menu"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"botb_info"},null],"c-4":["\n","^Rick nods. Barely perceptible. A millimeter at most.","\n","^Rick: Mm.","\n","end",null]}],null],"find_things":[["^Rick: *sigh*","\n","^Rick puts down the glass. This is significant. He never puts down the glass.","\n","^Rick: Back alley. Stuff out there.","\n","^Rick: Crowbar. Junk. Cat.","\n","ev","str","^A crowbar? What for?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Anything useful behind the bar?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^What about the cat?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^Thanks.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Prying.","\n","^A long pause.","\n","^Rick: ...things.","\n","^Rick: Heavy things don't move themselves.","\n","^Rick picks the glass back up. The wisdom dispensary is closed.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Rick: Duct tape. Counter.","\n","^He points with his chin. Maximum efficiency.","\n","^Rick: Fixes everything.","\n","^Rick: *pause*","\n","^Rick: Almost everything.","\n","^Rick stares into the middle distance. He might be thinking about his marriage. Or the plumbing. Same thing, maybe.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-2":["\n","^Rick: Cat's a cat.","\n","^Rick: Shows up. Leaves. Doesn't pay tab.","\n","^Rick: ...respect that, actually.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-3":["\n","^Rick: Mm.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"venue_history":[["^Rick puts down the glass again. He clears his throat. This is Rick preparing to give a speech.","\n","^Rick: 1974. Speakeasy.","\n","^Rick: 1981. Punk venue.","\n","^Rick: 1989. Jazz club. Three weeks. Bad idea.","\n","ev","str","^Why was jazz a bad idea?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What happened in the '90s?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Back to other topics.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Smooth jazz night. First and last.","\n","^Rick: Kenny G cover band. Called themselves \"Kenny H.\"","\n","^Rick: Audience rioted. Three saxophones broken. One trombone... missing.","\n","^Rick: We don't talk about the trombone.","\n","^Rick: *long sigh*","\n",{"->":"venue_history_2"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"venue_history_2"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"venue_history_2":[["^Rick: '93. Grunge.","\n","^Rick: Band called \"Apathy.\" Fitting.","\n","^Rick: Lead singer fell asleep during their own set. Audience thought it was performance art.","\n","^Rick: Four-star review in the local paper.","\n","ev","str","^That's amazing.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What about the 2000s?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Back to other topics.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Mm.","\n","^Rick: '99. Y2K party. Nothing crashed except the drum kit.","\n","^Rick: 2005. Emo phase. Bar went through a lot of black napkins.","\n","^Rick: 2010. Dubstep. I don't want to talk about 2010.","\n",{"->":"venue_history_3"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"venue_history_3"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"venue_history_3":[["^Rick: 2015. Venue almost closed.","\n","^Rick: Saved by a charity concert. Twelve bands. Forty-seven noise complaints.","\n","^Rick: 2020. ...closed. Obviously.","\n","^Rick: 2021. Reopened. Cockroaches held the fort.","\n","^Rick: Now... *gestures at everything*","\n","^Rick: ...this.","\n","ev","str","^You've been here through all of it?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Wow. That's... a lot of history.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Since '92.","\n","^Rick: Thirty-four years.","\n","^Rick: Three owners. Seven health inspections. Zero passed.","\n","^Rick: ...I've outlasted them all.","\n","^Rick picks up the glass again. Starts polishing. The circle of life.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Rick: History.","\n","^Rick: Or a cautionary tale.","\n","^Rick: Same thing.","\n","^Rick: *shrug*","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"drinks_menu":[["^Rick: Beer. Warm.","\n","^Rick: Whiskey. Questionable.","\n","^Rick: Water. ...also questionable.","\n","ev","str","^I'll have a beer.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What's in the whiskey?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^I'll pass.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick pours a beer. It's flat. It's warm. It's perfect for this venue.","\n","^Rick: Three bucks.","\n","^Rick: ...or a good story. Whichever.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Rick: Whiskey.","\n","^Rick: Probably.","\n","^Rick: Label fell off in 2014. We've been guessing since.","\n","^Rick: Regular says it tastes like \"regret with a smoky finish.\"","\n","^Rick: ...put that on the menu.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-2":["\n","^Rick: Smart.","\n","^Rick: ...first smart person I've met in here.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"botb_info":[["^Rick: Battle of the Bands.","\n","^Rick: *sigh*","\n","^Rick: Every year.","\n","^Rick: Twelve bands. Twelve dreams. Twelve disappointments.","\n","^Rick: ...usually.","\n","ev","str","^Any tips for entering?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Who usually wins?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Back to other topics.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Rick: Don't.","\n","^A pause.","\n","^Rick: ...but if you do.","\n","^Rick: Be real.","\n","^Rick: Audience smells fake. Like they smell the whiskey.","\n","^Rick: Can't fool either.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Rick: Last year. \"Existential Dread.\"","\n","^Rick: Year before. \"The Vacant Stares.\"","\n","^Rick: Year before that. \"My Landlord's Band.\"","\n","^Rick: ...they were actually the landlord's band. He owned the venue then.","\n","^Rick: Conflict of interest. Nobody cared.","\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"met_rick_before"},false,{"VAR=":"has_working_mic"},false,{"VAR=":"sal_is_mentor"},false,{"VAR=":"knows_about_botb"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}